# Anime Ace (Blambot) — the dialogue face. Its licence forbids redistributing
# the files, so they live on the machine and never in history: drop the
# Anime Ace 3 BB .otf files into app/assets/fonts/ as animeace3_{reg,bld,ital,bldital}.otf.
# Or install them in the OS instead, which the desktop app looks for first and which
# keeps them out of the installer. Without either the dialogue falls back to Shantell
# Sans. See app/assets/css/fonts.css.
app/assets/fonts/animeace*

release/
